# 1. Ignore absolutely everything by default
*

# 2. Allow Git to look inside folders (recursively) to track structure
!*/

# 3. DO NOT ignore code files anywhere (root or subfolders)
!*.R
!*.Rmd
!*.qmd
!*.py
!.gitignore

# 4. DO NOT ignore your specific R project configurations
!.Rproj.user/
!.Rhistory
!.RData
!.Ruserdata
